    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A Prophecy Against Babylon"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A prophecy against the Desert by the Sea:",
          "Like whirlwinds sweeping through the southland,",
          "an invader comes from the desert,",
          "from a land of terror."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A dire vision has been shown to me:",
          "The traitor betrays, the looter takes loot.",
          "Elam, attack! Media, lay siege!",
          "I will bring to an end all the groaning she caused."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "At this my body is racked with pain,",
          "pangs seize me, like those of a woman in labor;",
          "I am staggered by what I hear,",
          "I am bewildered by what I see."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My heart falters,",
          "fear makes me tremble;",
          "the twilight I longed for",
          "has become a horror to me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They set the tables,",
          "they spread the rugs,",
          "they eat, they drink!",
          "Get up, you officers,",
          "oil the shields!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "This is what the Lord says to me:",
          "“Go, post a lookout",
          "and have him report what he sees."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When he sees chariots",
          "with teams of horses,",
          "riders on donkeys",
          "or riders on camels,",
          "let him be alert,",
          "fully alert.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And the lookout shouted,",
          "“Day after day, my lord, I stand on the watchtower;",
          "every night I stay at my post."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Look, here comes a man in a chariot",
          "with a team of horses.",
          "And he gives back the answer:",
          "‘Babylon has fallen, has fallen!",
          "All the images of its gods",
          "lie shattered on the ground!’ ”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My people who are crushed on the threshing floor,",
          "I tell you what I have heard",
          "from the Lord Almighty,",
          "from the God of Israel."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A Prophecy Against Edom"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A prophecy against Dumah:",
          "Someone calls to me from Seir,",
          "“Watchman, what is left of the night?",
          "Watchman, what is left of the night?”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The watchman replies,",
          "“Morning is coming, but also the night.",
          "If you would ask, then ask;",
          "and come back yet again.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A Prophecy Against Arabia"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A prophecy against Arabia:",
          "You caravans of Dedanites,",
          "who camp in the thickets of Arabia,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "bring water for the thirsty;",
          "you who live in Tema,",
          "bring food for the fugitives."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They flee from the sword,",
          "from the drawn sword,",
          "from the bent bow",
          "and from the heat of battle."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "This is what the Lord says to me: “Within one year, as a servant bound by contract would count it, all the splendor of Kedar will come to an end."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The survivors of the archers, the warriors of Kedar, will be few.” The Lord, the God of Israel, has spoken."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
